WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.150 --> 00:00:22.490
Munda mu lubuto, omwana ali mu lubuto yeetooloddwa amaloboozi amagonvu era agakkakkanya omuli n’ago...

2
00:00:22.490 --> 00:00:31.870
okukuba kw’omutima gwa maama n’enkola y’okugaaya emmere n’amaloboozi n’amaloboozi okuva mu nsi ebweru. Nga

3
00:00:31.870 --> 00:00:38.750
olubuto lutuuka ku mitendera gyalwo egy’enkomerero, amaaso g’omwana gasobola okugguka munda mu lubuto. So nga tebasobola

4
00:00:38.750 --> 00:00:46.950
naye nga balaba ebifaananyi oba ebikwata ku nsonga eno, basobola okuwulira enkyukakyuka mu kitangaala. Kale, so nga obulamu mu lubuto buzibye

5
00:00:46.950 --> 00:00:56.840
era nga kizibu, kiri wala nnyo okusirika. Okuzaalibwa nkyukakyuka nnene nnyo eri omwana. Bayingira mangu

6
00:00:56.840 --> 00:01:03.820
ensi ejjudde ebifo ebipya, ebimasamasa n’amaloboozi amangi. Okumanyiira ensi eno empya kiba kya kuwulira

7
00:01:03.820 --> 00:01:10.340
okuzuukuka okutandika enkulaakulana yaabwe. Mu wiiki ezisooka ez’obulamu, omwana ajja...

8
00:01:10.340 --> 00:01:17.200
okukankana n’okuzuukuka singa wabaawo amaloboozi amangi. Amaaso gaabwe gawulira amataala agayakaayakana, .

9
00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:25.330
naye bakyasobola okulaba kitono nnyo. Kyokka okwolesebwa kwabwe kutandise okukulaakulana mu ngeri eyeewuunyisa

10
00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:33.240
omuwendo. Mu wiiki bbiri zokka, okulaba kulongooseddwa nnyo. Kati basobola okulaba ebimu ku bintu naddala

11
00:01:33.240 --> 00:01:39.780
singa ebintu biba kumpi. Tewali langi, era bye balaba biba bipapajjo kubanga amaaso gaabwe

12
00:01:39.780 --> 00:01:45.880
tebannaba bulijjo nga bagolokofu era nga bakolera wamu okusobola okutegeera obuziba. Oluusi amaaso gaabwe

13
00:01:45.880 --> 00:01:52.730
ejja kukulukuta n’eyingira oba efuluma okumala akaseera katono. Kino kiyitibwa okuzimba amaaso. Kino kisaana okulekera awo okubaawo

14
00:01:52.730 --> 00:02:00.340
ku myezi esatu. We gunaatuukira omwezi gumu, okulaba langi kutandise okukula. Bajja kuba bangi

15
00:02:00.340 --> 00:02:06.160
okusinga okufaayo okulaba naddala eri ffeesi. Era bajja kutandika okugezaako okugoberera ebintu

16
00:02:06.160 --> 00:02:13.030
ezitambula. Bajja kweyongera okumanya amaloboozi agamanyiddwa, nga mw’otwalidde n’amaloboozi agamanyiddwa ennyo

17
00:02:13.030 --> 00:02:19.450
amaloboozi, ng’ab’omu maka gaabwe, ne batandika okugatta bye bawulira n’ebyo bye bawulira

18
00:02:19.450 --> 00:02:24.820
laba. Ku myezi esatu, amaaso gaabwe bulijjo galina okuba nga gagoloddwa era nga gakolagana okuyiiya

19
00:02:24.820 --> 00:02:31.620
Okwolesebwa kwa 3D. Endowooza eno empya ey’obuziba ebayamba okutuuka ku bintu mu butuufu. Bano...

20
00:02:31.620 --> 00:02:37.240
ajja kusobola okugoberera ebintu ebitambula amangu. Mu kiseera kye kimu, amaloboozi ag’amakulu

21
00:02:37.240 --> 00:02:45.420
ejja kutandika okukolebwa. Ku myezi mukaaga, omwana alina okuba ng’asobola okutegeera abantu b’amanyi

22
00:02:45.420 --> 00:02:50.960
olw’amaaso gaabwe n’amaloboozi gaabwe. Era basobola okutandika okulaba ebintu ebigenda mu maaso

23
00:02:50.960 --> 00:02:57.880
ewala. Nga bavugibwa okwagala okumanya, bajja kutuuka ku bintu, baserengese gye bali, era, okwetooloola

24
00:02:57.880 --> 00:03:03.760
amazaalibwa gaabwe agasooka, okutambula. Enjogera yaabwe egenda ekula era amaloboozi gajja kusooka

25
00:03:03.760 --> 00:03:13.460
ebigambo ku mutendera guno nakyo. Ku myezi 18, okulaba kuba kufaanana nnyo ng’omuntu omukulu, wadde nga kukyaliwo

26
00:03:13.460 --> 00:03:20.520
a bit blurry. Kati bajja kusobola okutegeera erinnya lyabwe era nga beeyongera okukozesa ebigambo.

27
00:03:22.070 --> 00:03:28.300
Abalongo abamu bayinza obutatuuka ku bintu bino eby’enkula mu kiseera kye basuubirwa. Waliwo e

28
00:03:28.300 --> 00:03:34.210
ensonga nnyingi eziviirako kino, era bangi bajja kwetereeza. Okugeza abaana abazaalibwa nga tebanneetuuka

29
00:03:34.210 --> 00:03:40.920
ayinza okuba n’okulwawo, naye mu bujjuvu akwata oluvannyuma mu buto. Ku bamu, wayinza okubaawo okugumiikiriza

30
00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:47.710
ebizibu. Okuzuula bino nga bukyali okusobola okuwa obujjanjabi n‟obuyambi kiyinza

31
00:03:47.710 --> 00:03:49.210
okutumbula enkulaakulana.
